  set agreement between predicted and affected cells (hits / union), NOT a probability that the hypothesis is true

  Note what ranks and why. The narrowest hypothesis consistent with
  the data wins, because a hypothesis that predicts fifteen cells and
  explains one has OVER-PREDICTED fourteen. Parsimony is not imposed
  here; it falls out of comparing predicted cells with affected ones.

WHAT THIS DATA CANNOT DECIDE
  'a stock-out of Outdoor goods at Northeast-2'
  'a competitor opened near Northeast-2 selling'
  predict exactly the same cells. Ranking them would invent a
  preference the evidence does not support.

